              "text": "ഉച്ചഭക്ഷണം (uccabhakṣaṇaṁ) — \"lunch\": ഉച്ച (ucca), \"noon\", with ഭക്ഷണം (bhakṣaṇaṁ), \"food\". Both halves are words you know."
