          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ഉച്ചഭക്ഷണം (uccabhakṣaṇaṁ) joins ucca, \"noon\", from Sanskrit ucca, \"high\" (CDIAL 1634), the sun at its height, to Sanskrit bhakṣaṇa, \"food\"."
